      "source": [
        "# 1. Project Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "**EconoCausal – Uplift Modelling and Budget Optimization**\n",
        "\n",
        "The goal of this project is to apply uplift modelling to estimate the incremental impact of offering coupons (treatment) on a customer's purchase behavior (outcome) compared to not offering a coupon (control). By identifying which consumer segments respond most positively to treatments, we can optimize budget allocation to maximize incremental revenue and coupon efficiency."
      ]
    },
