      "source": [
        "# 4. Treatment and Control Group Definition\n",
        "\n",
        "Now we analyze the size, average purchase rates, and average discounts for each of the experimental groups:\n",
        "- **CGL**: Low-tier control\n",
        "- **T1L**: Low-tier treatment\n",
        "- **CGH**: High-tier control\n",
        "- **T1H**: High-tier treatment\n",
        "- **T2H**: Additional high-tier treatment\n",
        "\n",
        "This will help us map which treatment groups correspond to which control groups for a valid causal comparison."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 223
        },
        "id": "04c5c914",
        "outputId": "caa6527d-ae4e-4fff-90da-2e9cad3c9c65"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Group analysis: size, purchase rate, redeem rate, and average discount\n",
        "group_summary = df.groupby('group').agg(\n",
        "    count=('consumer_id', 'count'),\n",
        "    purchase_rate=('purchase', 'mean'),\n",
        "    redeem_rate=('redeem', 'mean'),\n",
        "    avg_discount=('discount', 'mean'),\n",
        "    avg_amount=('amount', 'mean')\n",
        ").reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"--- Summary statistics by Group ---\")\n",
        "display(group_summary)"
      ],
